register-form expectations failed; all were corrected without weakening the
type/extension/error checks. Final affected gate against 5895fbb: 1022 PASS,
0 FAIL, 4 historical ignored; Clippy -D warnings and fmt PASS. This is not a
complete workspace/offline-replay claim.

